{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118651","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118651/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118651/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118651/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118651","id":4277316604,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7TC6Ym","number":118651,"title":"Fix `TabBar` and `Label` being unable to shrink when given a maximum size","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":21,"created_at":"2026-04-16T17:05:52Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T23:05:43Z","closed_at":"2026-05-07T21:25:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118651","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118651","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118651.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118651.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-07T21:25:47Z"},"body":"In #116640, behavior was added to `TaBar` (and by extension `TabContainer`) and `Label`, which allowed them to expand whilst they have their clipping flag on up to their maximum sizes. This was implemented through their `get_minimum_size()` calls, which meant they not only expanded, but were also impossible to shrink. \r\n\r\nEx (4.7.dev4):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c8d9d36b-4960-4750-921a-fda017184630\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/225e7091-50bd-4db9-8a4d-d677c168a418\r\n\r\nThis PR has 3 commits that fix this:\r\n1. Fixes it for `TabBar`.\r\n2. Fixes it for `Label`.\r\n\r\nIn these first two commits, however, I introduced a regression: `TabBar` and `Label` within `Container` nodes would never expand. \r\n\r\n3. Reintroduces the behavior in Containers.\r\n\r\nThe way commit 3 accomplishes this is by introducing the concept of a \"desired size\" to `Control`. All `Container` nodes handle desired sizes in pretty much the exact same way as they handle minimum sizes. This allows them to grow based on their contents' desired sizes whilst retaining the ability to be shrunk to a minimum size based on their contents' minimum sizes.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the fixed behavior for non-contained `TabBar` and `Label` causes them to re-expand whenever their contents change. But if the contents don't change, they will stick to the given size. This means they have the same behavior before, but can be shrunk when you aren't changing their contents. This is, I think, the best approach.\r\n<sub> For a permanent shrinking, we have `custom_maximum_size` </sub>\r\n\r\nResult:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9054d3f8-9214-4a4d-b5bb-f254033be7cf\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7b871c16-4758-405f-8e67-0f68fa87e982\r\n\r\n\r\nCommits are separate for now for the sake of reviews; I will squash them upon approval.\r\nI consider this to be one bugfix, even though the 3rd commit technically added a non-exposed \"feature\". In the future, it might be worth considering exposing this \"feature\" with virtual calls, but that is beyond the scope of the bugfix, in my opinion.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118651/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118651/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}